WEBVTT

00:08:27.956 --> 00:08:31.356
And I don't believe
we will solve this crisis

00:08:31.356 --> 00:08:37.036
or act on the many opportunities
it presents us with

00:08:37.076 --> 00:08:39.516
until we've mobilized mindsets.

00:08:41.036 --> 00:08:44.636
So how do we shift out of despair,

00:08:44.676 --> 00:08:48.916
out of denial, towards something
radically different?

00:08:50.556 --> 00:08:52.916
There's a quote in "Spider-Man":

00:08:52.956 --> 00:08:56.476
"With great power
comes great responsibility."

00:08:57.676 --> 00:08:59.636
Yet what if the opposite is true?